  {
   "n": 3,
   "id": "49b701a",
   "doc": "wp-post#178927",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "Learn More"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>To explore <a href=\"/intro-to-cannabis-101/\">educational cannabis resources</a>, <a href=\"/menu/\">browse current product offerings</a>, or <a href=\"/faqs-420/\">learn more about visiting the dispensary</a>, or stop by and one of our knowledgeable budtenders will walk you through the process, explain our products and their effects, etc. and find what you are looking for…at your own pace.</p><p>For residents and visitors alike, Cape Cod Cannabis continues to demonstrate how a local dispensary can provide not only quality products, but also the knowledge and guidance consumers need to make informed cannabis decisions.</p><p><img src=\"assets/source/5a5f9798-Canna-101-CCC-Logo-300x272.png\" alt=\"Cannabis 101: A Beginner's Guide to Cannabis from Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet, MA\" width=\"300\" height=\"272\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Canna-101-CCC-Logo-300x272.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/2119ffa4-Canna-101-CCC-Logo.png\"></p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Always worth the trip!"
    }
   ]
  },
